repository-code: "https://github.com/Htbibalan/BAT"
url: "https://github.com/Htbibalan/BAT"

abstract: >
  BAT is a Python-based graphical tool for annotating animal behaviour
  from video recordings. It supports behavioural scoring from video,
  multi-user annotation, multi-animal annotation, and optional integration
  with tracking data such as DeepLabCut outputs.

